     "titulo": "Saying that two people are alike",
     "texto": [
      "**A 跟 B 一样 + adjective** means «A is as… as B»: **安娜跟妈妈一样高**. In English we say «as tall as»; in Chinese, **一样** goes before the adjective.",
      "**像 B 一样** also expresses similarity, with emphasis on «like B»."
